    "en": {
      "trackName": "MASH - Discover Your Future",
      "description": "MASH - The Classic Fortune Telling Game\n\nDiscover your hilarious, surprising, or shocking future with MASH, the beloved fortune prediction game that's entertained millions! Will you live in a beautiful Mansion, spacious Apartment, drafty Shack, or cozy House? Create funny stories about marriage, careers, kids, and more!\n\nPerfect for:\n\n• Sleepovers and parties with friends\n• Family game night entertainment\n• Quick, funny predictions anytime\n• Nostalgic fun for all ages\n\nHow to Play:\n\nSimply add names of crushes, dream jobs, cars, and more - then let MASH predict your outrageous future! Each round creates a unique, shareable story about your destiny.\nFeatures:\n\n• Unlimited fortunes - play again and again with different results\n• Share hilarious predictions via Messages, Instagram, Snapchat, and more\n• Save favorite fortunes to laugh at later\n• Kid-safe content perfect for ages 9+ (two questions deal with mortality and may not be suitable for children under 9)\n• Works on iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch\n• Amazing artwork by comic book artist Scott McMahon\n• Passcode protection for private fortunes\n\n20+ Categories, including: \n\nWho you'll marry, number of kids, future career, type of home, dream car, pets, honeymoon destination, college, and more!\n\nPlayers Love MASH:\n\n\"Brings back the best memories!\" 5 stars\n\n\"My grandkids and I play this together all the time\" 5 stars\n\n\"Perfect sleepover game\" 5 stars\n\nJoin millions of players creating hilarious futures with MASH!\n\n------------------------------------------\n\nApple TV owners: try our family-friendly party game, SketchParty TV",
      "releaseNotes": "Improved the design of the Apple Watch app.",
